<section class="how-i-work" aria-labelledby="how-i-work-heading">
  <h2 id="how-i-work-heading">06 / HOW I WORK</h2>

  <ol class="process-index" role="list">
    <li>
      <h3>Understand</h3>
      <p>Clarify the problem, constraints and expected behavior before choosing a solution.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Scope</h3>
      <p>Define what needs to be built now and what stays outside the current solution.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Build</h3>
      <p>
        Keep the implementation straightforward and use technology only when it serves a specific
        need.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Verify</h3>
      <p>
        Check the behavior most likely to fail and review the result against the expected behavior
        before considering the work complete.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Deliver</h3>
      <p>
        Leave the solution understandable, document what is useful, and make relevant limitations or
        next steps explicit.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

